cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "txaudit: privacy-preserving LLM auditor for Braintree checkout sagas"
abstract: >-
  Claude audits each checkout saga and recommends approve / void / refund /
  no_action / escalate. A deterministic policy guard checks every
  recommendation against fresh gateway state and executes or escalates. The
  model only sees an allow-listed, pseudonymized view with no PII or PCI data.
